_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEjU-RvNVU0LaG0KB-hul-ljVQ2NAHNrMVRHuO6y1D-PQ&oe=6A8EEDBE"}, {"file_name": "Pocus_2__16_9.png", "id": "937230505742267", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617729_937230512408933_3727197429448161329_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=r63kcAaJU2cQ7kNvwHQmIIN&_nc_oc=Ado7lQCSnjschEaBzIA6pOEnmfUuJW-724Rz69sC98m0Y3F0q9vl5kYEQg15onHkA_k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFkw6Xo1S_8wg7qhjEJ18aWZLY8yYsCfPQXtjWwSMDnRA&oe=6A8EDE36"}, {"file_name": "Pocus_1__16_9.png", "id": "965228606014452", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619697_965228609347785_8488936919973560370_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xnFW2S1A4ZgQ7kNvwFqVdTE&_nc_oc=AdoJMwmRssZlGStaML1gBYHv1LusJUGB0JHv1yJ0FSrbmA-E2JCbETwSqfVB-g2gZYE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH4l71oRcDrxCQb_wjT2ZJWO5ArmatXv99Z2WmbrCs2UQ&oe=6A8EE483"}, {"file_name": "Pocus_3__16_9.png", "id": "4100339310226775", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618069_4100339313560108_3936598336562042380_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bjWR_yLl5sAQ7kNvwGVa7BN&_nc_oc=AdrK_OL_bNoxCxwopIKp_SaroOwnDkEQpIm1S0khpBM7sMm8uaD47Bg9SfAaHXof8Xg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEK8nmBX1ZLjqXqzuOEJEx2yJOM6mEp7P-70lOzaZQqbA&oe=6A8EDFB0"}, {"file_name": "Pocus_5__16_9.png", "id": "1683228509368624", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618274_1683228512701957_5102167550855090008_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0N_gW_agKSAQ7kNvwHN2TxZ&_nc_oc=Adr2r2X5d9RXhu4qDDItWsKjwWbGcHmkFfjTWFcG19flgXDZoQZ__frON5fvUoBlltE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHZgZXUNTlcdo5yYVY-J1mx35bV8C-PbJ1HYsrsZSjXwA&oe=6A8EE266"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "PocusVR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# PocusVR - Meta Quest Store Description\n\n---\n\n## **Learn Point-of-Care Ultrasound in Immersive Virtual Reality**\n\n**PocusVR** brings POCUS (Point-of-Care Ultrasound) education directly to your space with cutting-edge virtual reality technology. Perfect for medical students, residents, and healthcare professionals.\n\n### **Training Areas:**\n- \ud83e\udec0 **Cardiac** - Rapid cardiac assessment and essential views\n- \ud83e\udec1 **Pulmonary** - Detection of pleural effusion and B-lines\n- \ud83d\udc0b **Abdominal** - Organ evaluation and free fluid assessment\n- \ud83d\udc80 **Cranial** - Transcranial ultrasound and measurements\n- \ud83e\ude78 **Doppler Color** - Real-time vascular flow analysis\n- \ud83e\uddb5 **Inguinal** - Assessment of vessels and inguinal region structures\n- \ud83e\uddb5 **Popliteal** - Popliteal region and vascular structure ultrasound\n\n### **Features:**\n\u2713 Realistic simulation with accurate anatomical models  \n\u2713 Immediate feedback on technique and findings  \n\u2713 Step-by-step protocols easy to follow  \n\u2713 Unlimited practice in a safe environment  \n\u2713 Intuitive virtual reality interface  \n\n### **Ideal For:**\nEmergency medicine physicians, critical care specialists, urgent care providers, anesthesiologists, and medical students.\n\n---\n\n**Master POCUS with confidence from anywhere!**\n\n{2416345472161976}\n{964784835962575}\n{2203614260390719}\n{814953447905793}\n{2134594520661540}\n{1661401091666738}", "short_description": "PocusVR brings POCUS (Point-of-Care Ultrasound) education directly to your space with cutting-edge virtual reality technology. Perfect for medical students, residents, and healthcare professionals."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.privacypolicies.com/live/ad6537e3-6466-4e81-98e3-5f364d29a866", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Aurora Pixel", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://pocusvr.co/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "C